type: software
title: "Typell"
abstract: "Type-theoretic verification kernel for formally verified database queries, providing dependent, linear, session, quantitative, effect, and modal type coverage. Idris 2 formal specs, Rust verification kernel, Zig FFI bridge, JSON-RPC protocol. The \"LLVM of type safety\" for query validation."
